    {
      "id": "knowhow-RCP-20260920-github-actions-tauri-004",
      "type": "knowhow",
      "title": "Expected Outcome",
      "summary": "PR/push 有可追踪的构建 artifact；`v*.*.*` tag 生成包含 Linux、Windows、macOS 安装包的 draft GitHub Release；tag 与应用元数据不一致时会在构建前失败。",
      "tags": [
        "github-actions",
        "tauri",
        "发布管线",
